    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<div class=\"spell-description\">\n  <p>\n      <strong>School:</strong>&nbsp;abjuration;\n    <br>\n    <strong>Level:</strong>&nbsp;Druid 5, Sorcerer 4, Wizard 4;\n    <strong>Domain:</strong>&nbsp;Earth 6, Strength 6;\n    \n    \n    \n    <br>\n    <strong>Components:</strong>&nbsp;V, S, M (granite and 250 gp worth of diamond dust sprinkled on the target’s skin)<br>\n    \n      <strong>Casting Time:</strong>&nbsp;1 standard action<br>\n    <strong>Range:</strong>&nbsp;touch<br>\n    \n    <strong>Target:</strong>&nbsp;creature touched<br>\n    \n    <strong>Duration:</strong>&nbsp;Special<br>\n    \n        <strong>Saving Throw:</strong>&nbsp;Will negates (harmless)\n        <br>\n        <strong>Spell Resistance:</strong>&nbsp;yes<br>\n  </p>\n  <h2>Description</h2>\n  \n\n\n<p>\nThe warded creature gains resistance to blows, cuts, stabs, and slashes. The subject gains damage reduction 10/adamantine. (It ignores the first 10 points of damage each time it takes damage from a weapon, though an adamantine weapon bypasses the reduction.) Once the spell has prevented a total of 10 points of damage per caster level (maximum 150 points), it is discharged.\n</p><p><i>Material Component:</i> Granite and 250 gp worth of diamond dust sprinkled on the target’s skin.\n</p>\n<hr/>\n\n\n\n</div>\n"
    },
